/p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>Navisworks Manage</span><span>Autodesk Construction Cloud</span><span>Solibri</span><span>Revit</span></div></div>  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How BIM Clash Detection <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Federate</h3><p>Discipline models aligned to shared coordinates and combined into one federated model.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Test</h3><p>Hard and clearance clash tests run by zone and system against agreed tolerances.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Resolve</h3><p>Clashes grouped, assigned to the responsible trade and tracked to closure in each coordination cycle.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Insights</p><h2 class=\"h2\">BIM Clash Detection, <em>explained.</em></h2><a class=\"btn dark\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" href=\"/insights/\">All insights <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/insights/ai-automation/ai-in-bim-coordination/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>AI in BIM Modeling and Coordination</b><span>Nov 2026</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/insights/technical-guides/reduce-bim-coordination-rework/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>How to Reduce BIM Coordination Rework</b><span>Nov 2026</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/insights/tech